<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuania auctions 85-day T-bills at 13.63 pct.</title>
<headline>Lithuania auctions 85-day T-bills at 13.63 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Lithuanian central bank auctioned 45 million litas of 85-day Treasury bills for an average yield of 13.63 percent on Monday, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>This compared with an average rate of 11.56 percent at a recent auction of 91-day paper, he added.</p>
<p>Amounts are in millions of litas.</p>
<p> MATURITY   AV YIELD  (LAST WEEK)   MIN/MAX    ISSUE  BID   SOLD</p>
<p>  85 days    13.63	11.56	12.0/14.72   45   64.496  45</p>
<p>The settlement date for today's auction is September 26 and the bills mature on December 20.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom +371 7 22 66 93</p>
